d 'XTPDROOT': module to perform second-generation panel unit-root and stationarity tests robust to cross-sectional dependence
d
d      xtpdroot collects panel unit-root and stationarity tests
d that control for cross-sectional    dependence through common
d factors (the PANIC approach) and, where relevant, structural	 
d breaks. Commands read the panel from xtset, return everything in
d r(), and ship    cross-linked help with a companion methods page.
d It complements xtflexur (factor-based    panel unit-root tests)
d and flexur (single-series tests). 
d
d KW: unit root tests
d KW: panel data
d KW: cross-sectional dependence
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260726
d
d Author:   Merwan Roudane, NA
d Support: email  merwanroudane920@@gmail.com
d
f xtbreaklm_example.do
f xtbreaklm_methods.sthlp
f xtbreaklm.ado
f xtbreaklm.sthlp
f xtfaclm_example.do
